{"ID":"20240118151019-ydx8qaz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151019-ydx8qaz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151019-ydx8qaz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151019-qfxjms9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152101-k7482pr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152040-di6wm98\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:27,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:27\u0026#125;","title":"278射干","type":"doc","updated":"20240204091919"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151019-qfxjms9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151019-qfxjms9","updated":"20240122152020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名乌扇，一名乌蒲。味苦，平，有毒。治咳逆上气，喉痹，咽痛，不得消息，散结气，腹中邪逆，食饮大热。生川谷田野。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152027-u8ni3vr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152027-u8ni3vr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，生于各地山中，为多年生草本，园圃亦可栽种，叶似菖蒲，其花可供玩赏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152029-ftbu5m2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152029-ftbu5m2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性平，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152030-6qmat2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152030-6qmat2w"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】射干清火解毒散血消痰要药，主咽喉肿痛，咳逆上气，降实火，利大肠，治积痰瘀血，热气结毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152032-p0xoqo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152032-p0xoqo7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗老血在心脾间，咳唾言语气臭，散胸中热气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152034-486r1ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152034-486r1ma"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治疰气消瘀血，通女人月闭。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152035-k6z0exw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152035-k6z0exw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】消痰破症结，胸膈满腹胀，气喘，痃癖，开胃下食，镇肝明目。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152037-134vpr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152037-134vpr2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】去胃中痈疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152039-ebcmudt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152039-ebcmudt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通钱半至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152040-di6wm98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152040-di6wm98","updated":"20240204091919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】性不益阴，凡脾胃弱，脏寒，气血虚，病无实热，均忌。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152042-lmn3nbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152042-lmn3nbt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】射干微苦，利喉中之痰。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152042-ava62zv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152042-ava62zv"}},{"ID":"20240122152043-ko2dfol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152043-ko2dfol"}},{"ID":"20240122152043-qfom06a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152043-qfom06a","updated":"20240204090203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二百七十八，射干，破音字，ye干，一叶的叶，叶干，这个是经方里面在使用的，治疗咳嗽上面张仲景在用它，所有的积痰瘀血、热气热咳的时候，我们都会使用这个射干。那经方里面有“射干麻黄汤”，就是这个射干。射干呢另外一个名字叫“乌扇”，诸位看这就是，也叫叶干，长的这个样子，看看这个。那剂量的时候，我们使用的时候，射干也是差不多，我平常起价都是三钱，三钱。这个药是很普遍的药，喉咙痛啊，喉咙堵塞啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240122152048-2rboz97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152048-2rboz97","updated":"20240122152059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】呢，味苦，性平，苦味的。【主治】呢，你看，射干清火解毒散血消痰主要的药物。当我们治疗咳嗽，热咳的时候，咳不止的时候，我们会用射干。那喉咙肿痛，半夏、射干都可以使用的。降实火，肺里面的实火。其它诸位看..."}]},{"ID":"20240122152057-wsghzqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152057-wsghzqd","updated":"20240122152104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【大明】消痰破症结，胸腔里面的，当你在诊断的时候，病人不管他里面是——这个肺结核、TB（Tuberculosis），或者是肺气肿，病人只要有咳嗽，里面有痰，里面有浓痰，一般都会用射干。射干是很好的入肺的药物。用它能够清火解毒，所以热症，肺家实热症的时候，用得很多。那平常呢一钱半到三钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240122152101-k7482pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152101-k7482pr","updated":"20240204091904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看【禁忌】，凡是脾胃虚弱，脏寒，气血虚的，病没有实热的，都是禁忌。一般来说实热的咳嗽，像百日咳啊、肺结核啊，我们都会使用到射干。"}]}]}